{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21045","headline":"夜来乐 · 李贺","name":"夜来乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红罗复帐金流苏，华灯九枝悬鲤鱼。\n丽人暎月开铜铺，春水滴酒猩猩沽。\n重一箧，香十株，赤金瓜子兼杂麸。\n五丝封青凫，阿侯此笑千万余。\n南轩汉转帘影疎，桐林哑哑挟子乌。\n劒崖鞭节青石珠，白騧吹湍凝霜须。\n漏长送佩承明庐，倡楼嵯峨明月孤。\n新客下马故客去，绿蝉秀黛重拂梳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}